Abstract = {This paper deals with the representation of complex volume shapes using
   a piece wise approximation by ellipsoids. The principle consists in
   optimizing a functional including an error term and a scale term. The
   result is a set of tangent or disjoint ellipsoids representing the shape
   in an intrinsic way. We propose a general scheme that we apply to 3D
   soil pore space modelling from volume Computed Tomography images. Within
   this specific context, we validate our geometrical modelling by using it
   for water draining simulation in porous media.},
